t -0.0407406,51.6769078; parcel_30763 / 46037757 at -0.052972,51.6767314; parcel_30764 / 45981756 at -0.0482579,51.6776898. All three have london_authority Enfield. The canonical file contains point carriers only, with no exact building polygon, Overture GERS ID or UPRN.","source_blob_sha":"ce7bf324533ac073de9f11c767a2d77ba94cc448","source_id":"canonical_parcel_label_2_sample","source_url":"https://github.com/cagdascagdas100/chat_gpt_clone_1/blob/codex/aays-single-runner-v5-20260706/england_map_web/data/distance_property_types/parcel_label_2_canonical_sample_latest.json","supports_fields":["parcel_id","hmlr_inspire_id","longitude","latitude","london_authority","building_geometry_absent","gers_id_absent","uprn_absent"]},{"accessed_at":"2026-08-02T18:34:30Z","content_sha256":"2a1d2217a94ea647ad654c7f5ea9db3909a712215058eadd1423bd1e83b59be6","hash_scope":"normalized_source_excerpt_utf8","license_or_terms_url":"https://docs.overturemaps.org/attribution/","publisher":"Overture Maps Foundation","record_scope":"Current release, schema version and public data retention policy.","relevant_record_ids_or_excerpt":"Overture Documentation Releases identifies 2026-07-22.0 as the current data release and v1.18.0 as its schema version. Public AWS and Azure release data is retained for a maximum of 60 days, so scripts must discover the current release instead of assuming an old path.","source_id":"overture_release_calendar","source_url":"https://docs.overturemaps.org/release-calendar/","supports_fields":["current_release_2026_07_22_0","schema_v1_18_0","60_day_public_release_retention"]},{"accessed_at":"2026-08-02T18:34:30Z","content_sha256":"c66a3f58207d67a1b7fab91e8fbea900c92756d7123627d112d7dcc1bbc5337c","hash_scope":"normalized_source_excerpt_utf8","license_or_terms_url":"https://docs.overturemaps.org/attribution/","publisher":"Overture Maps Foundation","record_scope":"Building semantics, current public cloud paths and ODbL.","relevant_record_ids_or_excerpt":"The Overture Buildings Guide defines building geometry as the outer footprint or roofprint and exposes the 2026-07-22.0 building dataset on public Amazon S3 and Microsoft Azure paths. The building theme combines open datasets and is published under ODbL.","source_id":"overture_buildings_guide","source_url":"https://docs.overturemaps.org/guides/buildings/","supports_fields":["building_footprint","roofprint","public_s3","public_azure","release_2026_07_22_0","ODbL"]},{"accessed_at":"2026-08-02T18:34:30Z","content_sha256":"23e188030c4ee89b236a0813648cf8b9d24cc5b93ab420d94bade1331822d1d6","hash_scope":"normalized_source_excerpt_utf8","license_or_terms_url":"https://docs.overturemaps.org/attribution/","publisher":"Overture Maps Foundation","record_scope":"STAC root/latest and building collection metadata contract.","relevant_record_ids_or_excerpt":"Overture's STAC catalog is the machine-readable release index. The root catalog exposes a latest release; a building collection URL follows the form /<release>/buildings/building/collection.json. Collection metadata includes feature count, license, columns and item links to parquet assets before data is downloaded.","source_id":"overture_stac_blog","source_url":"https://docs.overturemaps.org/blog/2026/02/11/stac/","supports_fields":["stac_root","latest_release","building_collection_url_pattern","feature_count","license","columns","item_links"]},{"accessed_at":"2026-08-02T18:34:30Z","content_sha256":"4932dbe017bcbfe17a3ded3c1d2b48a23ceae0f59415c77e7961f786fe27af0a","hash_scope":"normalized_source_excerpt_utf8","license_or_terms_url":"https://docs.overturemaps.org/attribution/","publisher":"Overture Maps Foundation","record_scope":"GeoParquet cloud distribution and metadata-first access.","relevant_record_ids_or_excerpt":"Overture publishes monthly global map data as GeoParquet on Amazon S3 and Microsoft Azure. The STAC catalog includes spatial extents, feature counts, column names and links to GeoParquet files; users can scan only needed cloud chunks instead of downloading the entire dataset.","source_id":"overture_cloud_sources","source_url":"https://docs.overturemaps.org/getting-data/cloud-sources/","supports_fields":["GeoParquet","cloud_native_query","spatial_extent","feature_count","columns","parquet_links"]},{"accessed_at":"2026-08-02T18:34:30Z","content_sha256":"bf397e67dced53b9d1871339d976ca42f276acd65f3d5d542f2192fa6f794186","hash_scope":"normalized_source_excerpt_utf8","license_or_terms_url":"https://docs.overturemaps.org/attribution/","publisher":"Overture Maps Foundation","record_scope":"Building identity, bbox and allowed geometry types.","relevant_record_ids_or_excerpt":"The Overture building schema provides id, bbox and geometry fields. Building geometry is a footprint or roofprint and the allowed geometry types are Polygon and MultiPolygon. A GERS-associated id is not equivalent to an HMLR INSPIRE ID or UPRN without independent binding proof.","source_id":"overture_building_schema","source_url":"https://docs.overturemaps.org/schema/reference/buildings/building/","supports_fields":["id","bbox","geometry","Polygon","MultiPolygon","gers_not_uprn_without_proof"]}],"source_head":"2374385dd38e302526a344fb27e040ef01864cb1","state":"READY","status":"ready","target_branch":"codex/aays-single-vunner-v5-20260706","task_id":"gas_emissions_2_official_technical_evidence_77_20260802","timeout_seconds":900,"updated_at":"2026-08-02T18:48:00Z","workstream_id":"AAYS_21_SLOT_SAFE_PARALLEL_V1"}
